</table>
</figure>
<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Sec. <a href="#S3.SS1" title="3.1 Training Data Preparation ‣ 3 MoGU Framework ‣ MoGU: A Framework for Enhancing Safety of Open-Sourced LLMs While Preserving Their Usability" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a>, we have collected rejection expressions for rule-based detection. Tab. <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix A Collection of Rejection Expressions ‣ MoGU: A Framework for Enhancing Safety of Open-Sourced LLMs While Preserving Their Usability" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> shows our collected rejection expressions.</p>
</div>
</section>
