<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Sec. <a href="#S3.SS1" title="3.1 Training Data Preparation ‣ 3 MoGU Framework ‣ MoGU: A Framework for Enhancing Safety of Open-Sourced LLMs While Preserving Their Usability" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a>, we provide in-context demonstrations for GPT-4 during the construction of (X<sub id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A2.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">b</span></sub>, Y<sub id="A2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A2.p1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">g</span></sub>), (X<sub id="A2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A2.p1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">b</span></sub>, Y<sub id="A2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A2.p1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">r</span></sub>) and (X<sub id="A2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A2.p1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">m</span></sub>, Y<sub id="A2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A2.p1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">r</span></sub>). The provided demonstrations are detailed in Tab. <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix B In-Context Demonstrations for GPT-4 ‣ MoGU: A Framework for Enhancing Safety of Open-Sourced LLMs While Preserving Their Usability" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
