<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Case Study</h2>

<figure id="A6.T11" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>After applying SafeDecoding and MoGU, real response cases of Vicuna<sub id="A6.T11.3" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A6.T11.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">7B</span></sub> when faced with the malicious instruction and benign instruction. Our MoGU strategy provides a harmless response when faced with malicious instruction and a useful response when faced with benign instruction.</figcaption>
