<td id="A6.T11.4.4.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A6.T11.4.4.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">ethical and moral principles. As an AI language model…</span></td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
